<title>FINLAND: SUUNTO JAN-AUG PROFIT FALLS 35 PCT.</title>
<headline>SUUNTO JAN-AUG PROFIT FALLS 35 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight months to Aug 31, 1996</p>
<p>				    (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after financial items	   15.7 vs 24.0</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)	    2.06 vs 3.85</p>
<p> Net sales				   187.9 vs 197.0</p>
<p> Operating profit			   18.3 vs 28.1</p>
<p>Operating profit before depreciation 25.2 vs 34.5</p>
<p> Depreciation				  6.9 vs 6.4</p>
<p> Net financial items		charge 2.6 vs 4.1 charge</p>
<p> Taxes					   4.4 vs 2.8</p>
<p> Profit before minorities		 11.3 vs 21.2</p>
<p> Minorities			   charge 0.2 vs 0.4 charge</p>
<p> Net profit				   11.1 vs 20.8</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	 51 vs 48</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish sport compass maker is Suunto</p>
<p>Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 0 6805 0245</p>
</text>
